  cal-20261002-s4-003,s1,"data/notes.md, 2026-10-02 entry (answers after the agents acted)","https://github.com/yujieteo/site/blob/ff0c675b6072cf10768644132fb6936fd8cf1f1d/data/notes.md#L16",2026-10-02,"2026-10-02T07:28:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s4-003,s2,yujieteo/site pull request 125 (data-only fast path),"https://github.com/yujieteo/site/pull/125","2026-10-02T06:48:08Z","2026-10-02T07:28:00Z"
