claims[119]{question_id,source_id,claim}:
  cal-20261002-s4-001,s1,My review stays at decisions and outcomes; the safeguards I chose are automated.
  cal-20261002-s4-002,s1,Six of nine dated-todo cards in session 3 were left as notes.
  cal-20261002-s4-003,s1,Twice in session 3 the work landed before or around the card that asked about it.
  cal-20261002-s4-003,s2,"PR 125 merged at 06:48 UTC on 2 October, a minute before its card was answered."
  cal-20261002-s4-004,s1,"Agent tooling should help me become a better human, not merely replace more tasks."
  cal-20261002-s4-005,s1,"Stage B compares checksums, requires HTTP 200 and checks for expected text."
  cal-20261002-s4-005,s2,I trust automated checks over my own review.
  cal-20261002-s4-006,s1,Set a monthly spend cap now.
  cal-20261002-s4-007,s1,Folding the repositories back conflicts with starting more of them.
  cal-20261002-s4-007,s2,"yujieteo has 61 public repositories; outside stars: none."
  cal-20261002-s4-008,s1,Explaining one étale result to a person beats writing a note on it; find one listener in November.
  cal-20261002-s4-009,s1,Three sessions were exported on 2 October 2026.
  cal-20261002-s4-010,s1,Repository creation goes to one supervised step with the Administration permission.
  cal-20261002-s4-011,s1,Budget the fleet rather than wind it down; invest in firstmate's tooling now.
  cal-20261002-s4-012,s1,The Brier score over the 21 resolved questions is 0.228.
  cal-20261002-s4-013,s1,The audit revokes classic personal access tokens first.
  cal-20261002-s4-014,s1,"Deploys upload under temporary names, verify checksums and rename atomically, by hand."
  cal-20261002-s4-014,s2,Harden the deploy path before GitHub.
  cal-20261002-s4-015,s1,"Move the agent curfew from midnight to 23:00 and enforce it with a hook or mod."
  cal-20261002-s4-016,s1,"When withdrawing, distinguish evidence about others' preferences from self-blame."
  cal-20261002-s4-017,s1,Book two fixed mathematics blocks a week.
  cal-20261002-s4-018,s1,Public repositories are the better signal than certificates.
  cal-20261002-s4-019,s1,Set a retirement rule now.
